<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμᾰκ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>of the nature of a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον,</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>medicinal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				624a18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mir.</u>
				835b32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				863b32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.15.4
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>CP</u>
					6.4.6
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -ωδέστερα φάρμακα</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>poisonous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.974c
			</span></i>; <i>poisoned,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοξεύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.80
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.17b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of places,
				<i>rich in medicinal herbs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.15.4
			</span></i> (Posit. and 
				Sup.
			).</div>
